I have enough to answer. There is one root cause, and the evidence supports it.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-preserve-service",
      "fault_kind": "http_response_body_corrupted",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_http_request_method m, attr_http_response_status_code code, attr_status_code, COUNT(*) n FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND span_name='GET' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Normal period: preserve's outbound GET to security returns 200 with Unset status on 342 calls."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_http_request_method m, attr_http_response_status_code code, attr_status_code, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND span_name='GET' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Abnormal period: all 1603 of preserve's outbound GET calls return 404 with Error status."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_http_response_status_code code, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-security-service' AND span_name LIKE 'GET%' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Security receives requests on path 'GET /**' and answers 404, where normal traffic used securityConfigs/{accountId}."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name, p.span_name, c.service_name child_svc, c.attr_http_response_status_code code, COUNT(*) n, AVG(p.duration)/1e6 avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND p.span_name='POST /api/v1/preserveservice/preserve' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "ui-dashboard preserve requests now return 500 after calling preserve; average about 3.8 s for failed calls."},
        {"kind": "log", "sql": "SELECT service_name, level, attr_log_template, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name='ts-preserve-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Preserve logs a SEVERE 'Request processing failed' exception on every one of 1603 requests."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-preserve-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name, c.service_name child_svc, c.attr_status_code, c.attr_http_response_status_code code, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND c.service_name='ts-preserve-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Every ui-dashboard call into preserve (1603) comes back as an Error 500, so user preserve requests fail."}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
